{"id":"acda8ebf92673c3d","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-soundness-predicate.md","title":"声性谓词","display":"df-soundness-predicate — 声性谓词","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-soundness-predicate","aliases":["91-df-soundness-predicate"],"display":"df-soundness-predicate — 声性谓词","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-soundness-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-soundness-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-soundness-predicate — 声性谓词"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-soundness-predicate-—-声性谓词-$\\mathrm{Sound}$\">df-soundness-predicate — 声性谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (递归公理化理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的算术化可证性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 语言的句子编码谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}(x)\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_S(x)\\rightarrow T(x)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}(x)\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_S(x)\\rightarrow T(x)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}\\)</span> : 声性谓词（soundness predicate）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\\)</span>：用对象语言真理谓词表达的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 声性</li>\n</ul>\n<p>声性谓词的含义：\n声性谓词断言理论的所有可证句子都是真的。这是比一致性更强的条件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一致性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\\)</span></li>\n<li>真理化声性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x(\\mathrm{Sent}(x)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_S(x)\\to T(x))\">\\(\\forall x(\\mathrm{Sent}(x)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_S(x)\\to T(x))\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>声性等价于全局反射原则（见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" href=\"?note=fa1e29f5683a4d6f\" title=\"91-df-reflection-principle\">91-df-reflection-principle</a>）：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>声性在真理理论中的地位：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>声性蕴含相应一致性，但不同公式类的反射原则未必形成单一线性强度</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 足够强且一致，它不能证明蕴含自身一致性的充分内部声性断言</li>\n<li>语义声性“所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 定理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 中为真”与真理化对象句相关但层级不同</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-soundness-predicate-—-声性谓词-$\\mathrm{Sound}$","text":"df-soundness-predicate — 声性谓词 $\\mathrm{Sound}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-reflection-principle","status":"resolved","id":"fa1e29f5683a4d6f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"声性等价于全局反射原则（见[[91-df-reflection-principle]]）：","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}(x)\\land\n\\mathrm{Prov}_S(x)\\rightarrow T(x)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x(\\mathrm{Sent}(x)\\land\\mathrm{Prov}_S(x)\\to T(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_T(S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S).","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false}],"bytes":1658,"backlinks":[{"id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"全局反射可作为一种形式化声性断言（见 [[91-df-soundness-predicate]]）"},{"id":"954547d789193344","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这里的 $\\operatorname{ArSound}$ 是元层语义性质；它不同于\n[[91-df-soundness-predicate]] 中用对象语言真理谓词表达的\n$\\mathrm{Sound}_T(\\mathcal T)$。"},{"id":"ae206ab556213266","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cb582ee79087af80","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"07845482f0a2f378","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.